# (ข้อมูลภารกิจ/ฟังก์ชันสถานะของบอร์ดเมืองลอยฟ้า ย้ายขึ้นไปประกาศก่อนโมดูลเครือข่ายภารกิจ เพราะโมดูลนั้นอ้างถึงตอนโหลดไฟล์)

@app.route("/api/sky-city/mission-board", methods=["GET"])
def api_sky_city_mission_board():
    uid = _vmax_mission_uid(request.args.get("uid"))
    return jsonify({
        "st": "ok",
        "board": VMAX_SKY_CITY_MISSION_BOARD,
        "missions": [
            {**m, **_pass_mission_game_info(m), "state": _vmax_mission_state(uid, m["id"])}
            for m in VMAX_SKY_CITY_MISSIONS.values()
        ],
    })

@app.route("/api/sky-city/mission-board/accept", methods=["POST"])
def api_sky_city_mission_accept():
    data = request.get_json(silent=True) or {}
    uid = _vmax_mission_uid(data.get("uid"))
    mid = str(data.get("mission_id") or "").strip()
    mission = VMAX_SKY_CITY_MISSIONS.get(mid)
    if not mission:
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ไม่พบภารกิจบนบอร์ด"}), 404
    state = _vmax_mission_state(uid, mid)
    if state["status"] not in ("available", "cancelled"):
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ภารกิจนี้รับไปแล้ว"}), 409
    state.update({
        "status": "active",
        "progress": 0,
        "required": max(1, int(mission.get("objective", {}).get("count", 1))),
        "reward_claimed": False,
        "accepted_at": time.time(),
        "accepted_source": {"type": "sky_city", "id": "sky_city_mission_board"},
    })
    return jsonify({"st": "ok", "mission": mission, **_pass_mission_game_info(mission), "state": state})

@app.route("/api/sky-city/mission-board/progress", methods=["POST"])
def api_sky_city_mission_progress():
    data = request.get_json(silent=True) or {}
    uid = _vmax_mission_uid(data.get("uid"))
    mid = str(data.get("mission_id") or "").strip()
    mission = VMAX_SKY_CITY_MISSIONS.get(mid)
    if not mission:
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ไม่พบภารกิจ"}), 404
    _need_game = _pass_mission_requires_game(mission)
    if _need_game:
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ภารกิจนี้ต้องไปทำในเกม " + str(PASS_GAMES[_need_game].get("name_th") or _need_game),
                        "target_game_id": _need_game}), 403
    state = _vmax_mission_state(uid, mid)
    if state["status"] != "active":
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ภารกิจยังไม่ได้รับ"}), 409
    state["progress"] = min(
        state["required"],
        int(state.get("progress", 0)) + max(1, int(data.get("amount", 1)))
    )
    if state["progress"] >= state["required"]:
        state["status"] = "ready_to_submit"
    return jsonify({"st": "ok", "state": state})

@app.route("/api/sky-city/mission-board/submit", methods=["POST"])
def api_sky_city_mission_submit():
    data = request.get_json(silent=True) or {}
    uid = _vmax_mission_uid(data.get("uid"))
    mid = str(data.get("mission_id") or "").strip()
    if mid not in VMAX_SKY_CITY_MISSIONS:
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ไม่พบภารกิจ"}), 404
    state = _vmax_mission_state(uid, mid)
    if state["status"] != "ready_to_submit":
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ภารกิจยังทำไม่ครบ"}), 409
    state["status"] = "submitted"
    state["submitted_at"] = time.time()
    return jsonify({"st": "ok", "submitted": True, "claim_available": True, "state": state})

@app.route("/api/sky-city/mission-board/claim", methods=["POST"])
def api_sky_city_mission_claim():
    data = request.get_json(silent=True) or {}
    uid = _vmax_mission_uid(data.get("uid"))
    mid = str(data.get("mission_id") or "").strip()
    mission = VMAX_SKY_CITY_MISSIONS.get(mid)
    if not mission:
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ไม่พบภารกิจ"}), 404
    state = _vmax_mission_state(uid, mid)
    if state["status"] != "submitted":
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "ยังไม่มีรางวัลให้รับ"}), 409
    if state.get("reward_claimed"):
        return jsonify({"st": "error", "msg": "รับรางวัลไปแล้ว"}), 409
    state["reward_claimed"] = True
    state["status"] = "completed"
    state["completed_at"] = time.time()
    _pass_mission_claimed(uid, mid, state, "sky_city", "sky_city_mission_board")   # EXP ให้ 2 พาส + พาสเกมอื่น
    return jsonify({
        "st": "ok",
        "mission_completed": True,
        "reward": dict(mission.get("reward") or {}),
        "state": state,
    })

