# ============================================================
# Hotel rooms are a persistent city service.  Players can walk to the
# hotel, rent a room, shower, use the bathroom, rest, and manage basic
# personal-use items.  The system is intentionally data-driven so room
# prices and amenities can be tuned without changing the game logic.
