# ---- ส่วนที่เหลือ: รายการบิลของผู้ใช้ + หน้าแสดงรหัส + แคตตาล็อกช่องทางจ่าย ----
def vmax_billpay_list_for_uid(uid, limit=30):
    uid = str(uid or "anon")
    items = []
    with _BP_LOCK:
        for b in VMAX_BILLPAY_ORDERS.values():
            if b.get("uid") == uid:
                _bp_expire_if_needed(b)
                items.append(_bp_public_view(b))
    # also scan disk lightly
    try:
        for fn in _bp_os.listdir(VMAX_BILLPAY_DATA_DIR):
            if not fn.startswith("bill_"):
                continue
            path = _bp_os.path.join(VMAX_BILLPAY_DATA_DIR, fn)
            try:
                with open(path, "r", encoding="utf-8") as f:
                    b = _bp_json.load(f)
                if b.get("uid") == uid and not any(x["bill_id"] == b.get("bill_id") for x in items):
                    _bp_expire_if_needed(b)
                    items.append(_bp_public_view(b))
            except Exception:
                pass
    except Exception:
        pass
    items.sort(key=lambda x: float(x.get("created_at") or 0), reverse=True)
    return items[:int(limit)]


